# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dravidian pilot — cross-machine sync carve-outs
#
# The blanket *.csv / *.json / *.xlsx rules above are right for bulk data, but
# a few small files are hand-curated state that CANNOT be regenerated. Those
# are force-tracked here so a second machine gets full working context.
#
# Everything still ignored is either (a) a source-of-truth scrape synced via
# Box, or (b) derived output rebuildable from those scrapes + tracked code.
# See docs/SYNC.md for the split and the Mac bootstrap procedure.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Hand-curated triage state — irreplaceable, no script regenerates this
!data/dravidian/burrow_ded/review_ledger.json

# Current validation summary only. The .before-x/.pre-x snapshots taken during
# A/B runs stay ignored — they accumulated to 34 files and were cleared; recover
# any you need from history rather than re-tracking them.
!tree_validation_output/tree_validation_summary.json

# Active review worklists
!tree_validation_output/loop_worklist.json
!tree_validation_output/genuine_divergence_worksheet.csv

# Never track regenerable snapshot baselines (large, dead history)
tree_validation_output/results.*.csv
tree_validation_output/tree_validation_results.*.csv
data/dravidian/burrow_ded/burrow_corpus.cleaned.*.json

# transient build/error logs from local loop runs
tree_validation_output/loop_build_err.txt
